const char* const portSl3Text[] = {
    "sl_c3_arrive_01", "<system>\nCircuit Break Island.\nYou hear it before you see it.\n<k>",
    "sl_c3_arrive_02", "Whoa! What IS that racket? It\nsounds like a thousand\nblenders full of gravel!\n<k>",
    "sl_c3_arrive_03", "Engines, Sir Luigi. Many\nengines. Plumpbelly has but\none, and we keep it in a\n<k>\n<p>\nmuseum.\n<k>",
    "sl_c3_arrive_04", "Loud. I like it.\n<k>",
    "sl_c3_arrive_05", "The compass pointed right\nhere. Somewhere in all that\nnoise is a piece of it.\n<k>\n<p>\nProbably. I hope. Let's go,\nteam! ...Carefully!\n<k>",
    "sl_c3_sign_31", "<system>\nCircuit Break Island.\nPopulation: loud.\n<k>",
    "sl_c3_awards_01", "LADIES! GENTLEMEN! KOOPAS OF\nALL AGES! For the THIRTY-FIRST\nday in a ROW,\n<k>\n<p>\nthe winner of the Circuit\nBreak Grand Prix, and\ntherefore KING OF THIS ISLAND\n<k>\n<p>\nuntil tomorrow's race,\nissss...\n<k>",
    "sl_c3_awards_02", "KIIIIING REVVOOOOO!\n<k>",
    "sl_c3_awards_03", "That... that's... THAT'S A\nPIECE OF THE MARVELOUS\nCOMPASS! On a TROPHY!\n<k>\n<p>\nOh, I think I need to sit\ndown.\n<k>",
    "sl_c3_awards_04", "Steady, sir. Steady.\n<k>",
    "sl_c3_awards_05", "Thank you, thank you. Please,\nhold your applause. No, don't.\nKeep it coming.\n<k>",
    "sl_c3_awards_06", "As your king, my first decree\nis the same as yesterday's:\neverybody say \"Long live King\n<k>\n<p>\nRevvo!\"\n<k>",
    "sl_c3_awards_07", "<system>\n<dynamic 3>Long live King Revvo!</dynamic>\n<k>",
    "sl_c3_awards_08", "My second decree: that was\ngreat, do it again tomorrow.\n<k>",
    "sl_c3_awards_09", "You're new, huh? Here's how it\nworks. Every day there's a\nrace.\n<k>\n<p>\nWhoever wins is king of the\nisland till the next one.\n<k>\n<p>\nThe king gets the crown, the\ncape, the trophy, and the\nparking space.\n<k>",
    "sl_c3_awards_10", "Revvo's won every race for a\nmonth. Nobody can beat him.\nMostly 'cause nobody can get\n<k>\n<p>\nnear him.\n<k>\n<p>\nHis karts have missiles. And\nbazookas. And a smaller\nbazooka for the bazooka.\n<k>",
    "sl_c3_awards_11", "Missiles?! In a RACE?! What\nhappened to good, clean,\nfamily karting?!\n<k>",
    "sl_c3_awards_12", "Anything goes on Circuit\nBreak, mister. It's in the\nrules. The rules are just that\n<k>\n<p>\none sentence.\n<k>",
    "sl_c3_awards_13", "OK. OK, OK, OK. So the compass\npiece is on the trophy, and\nthe trophy goes to the winner.\n<k>\n<p>\nSo all we have to do is...\n<k>",
    "sl_c3_awards_14", "Win.\n<k>",
    "sl_c3_awards_15", "A race. In a war machine.\nAgainst a king with a bazooka\nfor his bazooka.\n<k>",
    "sl_c3_awards_16", "...Let's just go see how you\nsign up. Just to look! Looking\nis free!\n<k>",
    "sl_c3_hq_01", "Welcome to Race HQ! Spectator\ntickets are on the left,\nautographs are on the right,\n<k>\n<p>\nand crying is outside.\n<k>",
    "sl_c3_hq_02", "Hi! I'd like to enter the next\nrace, please. I'm Luigi.\n<k>\n<p>\nSuper Luigi, if you want the\nwhole thing. Most people\ndon't.\n<k>",
    "sl_c3_hq_03", "A rookie! How exciting. Very\nrare. Mostly they don't come\nback.\n<k>",
    "sl_c3_hq_04", "To start the Grand Prix you\nneed three things. One: a\nkart.\n<k>\n<p>\nTwo: a licensed pit mechanic.\nThree: a racing license.\n<k>",
    "sl_c3_hq_05", "You get a racing license by\nwinning the Bumper Bouts in\nthe Stadium. Five wins and\n<k>\n<p>\nyou're licensed.\n<k>\n<p>\nDirector Gasket runs those,\nthrough the door and down Pit\nLane.\n<k>",
    "sl_c3_hq_06", "Bumper Bouts? Like... bumper\ncars? That sounds fun!\n<k>",
    "sl_c3_hq_07", "Bumper as in \"you get bumped.\"\nBy Hammer Bros. In a ring.\n<k>\n<p>\nHere's your rookie badge!\nDon't lose it, we don't have\nanother.\n<k>",
    "sl_c3_hq_got_pass", "<system>\nLuigi got the <col 0000ffff>Rookie Pass</col>!\n<k>",
    "sl_c3_bout_medic", "<system>\nThe ring medics patch Luigi up.\n<k>",
    "sl_c3_hq_stadium_shut", "<system>\nAudience doors. Shut till the Grand\nPrix. Fighters go in from Pit Lane.\n<k>",
    "sl_c3_hq_locked", "<system>\nStaff and racers only.\nCheck in at the desk first.\n<k>",
    "sl_c3_hq_tutor", "Oh, and that chest behind me?\nLost and found. Been here\nsince the first race. Nobody's\n<k>\n<p>\nclaimed it.\n<k>\n<p>\nYou look like you need it.\n<k>",
    "sl_c3_hq_tutor_no", "Hands off the lost and found,\nrookie. Win a bout first. Then\nwe'll talk.\n<k>",
    "sl_c3_hq_stamp", "Oh! You came back! That's\nnever happened!\n<k>\n<p>\nOne Racing License, stamped.\nGood luck tomorrow. You'll\nneed it. Everybody does.\n<k>",
    "sl_c3_npc_checkers_01", "The Director's office is down\nPit Lane. Through the door on\nyour left. Or your right. It's\n<k>\n<p>\na loop.\n<k>",
    "sl_c3_npc_checkers_02", "Two wins? For a rookie? I'll\nhave to find a bigger rubber\nstamp.\n<k>",
    "sl_c3_npc_checkers_03", "I always said you had it in\nyou. I said it this morning.\nQuietly. To myself.\n<k>",
    "sl_c3_npc_reporter_00", "No comment? I didn't ask\nanything yet. Come back when\nyou've been bumped.\n<k>",
    "sl_c3_npc_reporter_01", "Rookie! How do you feel?\n<k>",
    "sl_c3_npc_reporter_02", "Rookie! Is it true you cried?\n<k>",
    "sl_c3_npc_reporter_03", "Rookie! Is it true you're\ngoing to fight the KING?\n<k>",
    "sl_c3_npc_reporter_04", "Luigi! Can I have an\nautograph?\n<k>",
    "sl_c3_director_01", "Step right up, step right up!\nFresh meat for the Bumper\nBouts!\n<k>\n<p>\nOhhh, look at those knees\nknocking, the crowd's gonna\nLOVE you!\n<k>",
    "sl_c3_director_02", "Rules are simple! You go in\nthe ring, you fight whoever I\nput in there, the last one\n<k>\n<p>\nstanding wins!\n<k>\n<p>\nWin five and you're licensed\nto race! Lose and you go home\nwith a lovely bruise!\n<k>",
    "sl_c3_director_03", "Do I get to pick who I fight?\n<k>",
    "sl_c3_director_04", "Ha! HA! No.\n<k>",
    "sl_c3_director_05", "First bout's open now. But\nlisten, rookie: no kart, no\nlicense, no race.\n<k>\n<p>\nAnd no mechanic will touch a\nrookie's kart. You'll want to\nfind somebody desperate.\n<k>\n<p>\nTry the last garage on Pit\nLane. Bring earplugs. And a\ntreat. He bites.\n<k>",
    "sl_c3_director_mech", "Mechanic first, rookie! Last\ngarage on Pit Lane! I'll keep\nthe ring warm!\n<k>",
    "sl_c3_director_bout1", "Bout one, rookie! The crowd's\nwarmed up!\n<k>",
    "sl_c3_director_torque", "Two down! And somebody's\nwaiting for you out in Pit\nLane, looking grumpy.\n<k>\n<p>\nGrumpier.\n<k>",
    "sl_c3_director_kart", "Whoa, whoa! The King's Bout is\nfor racers! No kart, no King!\nGo get your little go-kart\n<k>\n<p>\nbuilt!\n<k>",
    "sl_c3_director_king", "This is it, rookie! The fifth\nbout! The KING'S BOUT!\nNobody's ever won it!\n<k>",
    "sl_c3_director_exhib", "Exhibition bouts! No license\nat stake! Just glory! And\nprizes!\n<k>",
    "sl_c3_director_done", "You've beaten everybody I've\ngot, kid. Go race! Shoo!\n<k>",
    "sl_c3_director_ask", "So! Fight the next bout?\n<o>",
    "sl_c3_director_yesno", "<select 0 1 0 40>\nLet's go!\nNot yet",
    "sl_c3_director_go", "<p>\nThat's the spirit! Out to the ring with you!\n<k>",
    "sl_c3_director_later", "<p>\nSuit yourself! The bruises will wait!\n<k>",
    "sl_c3_cabinet_empty", "<system>\nFiles. Lots of files. All of them\nabout King Revvo.\n<k>",
    "sl_c3_vent_open", "Vent's open. After you. You're\nskinnier.\n<k>",
    "sl_c3_torque_meet_01", "Closed.\n<k>",
    "sl_c3_torque_meet_02", "But the door was open.\n<k>",
    "sl_c3_torque_meet_03", "Door's broken. Garage is\nclosed.\n<k>",
    "sl_c3_torque_meet_04", "I'm looking for a mechanic.\nI'm entering the Grand Prix!\n<k>",
    "sl_c3_torque_meet_05", "You. Racing. With what?\n<k>",
    "sl_c3_torque_meet_06", "That's the other thing. I was\nhoping you'd have a kart.\n<k>",
    "sl_c3_torque_meet_07", "...No.\n<k>",
    "sl_c3_torque_meet_08", "Sir, there is plainly a kart\nunder that sheet. It has\nwheels. They are sticking out.\n<k>",
    "sl_c3_torque_meet_09", "That's not a kart. That's the\nGirl. Big Green 01. Fastest\nthing I ever built.\n<k>\n<p>\nNever been raced. Never will\nbe. Not by a rookie with a\nmustache.\n<k>",
    "sl_c3_torque_meet_10", "Hey, the mustache has been in\na LOT of adventures!\n<k>",
    "sl_c3_torque_meet_11", "Anyway she's missing parts.\nSomebody cleaned me out last\nweek. Spark plug, steering\n<k>\n<p>\nwheel, gearbox. Gone.\n<k>",
    "sl_c3_torque_meet_12", "Who.\n<k>",
    "sl_c3_torque_meet_13", "Who do you think? Revvo's\ncrew. Can't have a kart faster\nthan the King's on the island,\n<k>\n<p>\ncan we.\n<k>",
    "sl_c3_torque_meet_14", "So if we found your parts...\n<k>",
    "sl_c3_torque_meet_15", "Then I'd have my parts back.\nGood day.\n<k>",
    "sl_c3_npc_torque_under", "Still closed.\n<k>",
    "sl_c3_tarp_look", "<system>\nSomething big under a green\ntarp. Its wheels stick out.\n<k>",
    "sl_c3_kart_look", "<system>\nBig Green 01. Low, bright green,\nand very, very shiny.\n<k>",
    "sl_c3_bout1_intro", "In the red corner, a team that\nNEVER misses a pit stop,\nbecause they ARE the pit\n<k>\n<p>\nstop...\n<k>\n<p>\nTHE LUG NUTS!\n<k>\n<p>\nAnd in the green corner, a\nROOKIE who signed up an HOUR\nAGO... LUIGI!\n<k>",
    "sl_c3_bout2_intro", "They're spiky! They're from\nthe sky! They are absolutely\nnot allowed in the parking\n<k>\n<p>\nlot!\n<k>\n<p>\nIt's... THE SPIKE STRIP!\n<k>",
    "sl_c3_bout3_intro", "They're shady! They're shelly!\nThey hold every grudge they've\never met! It's... THE SHELL\n<k>\n<p>\nSHOCKERS!\n<k>",
    "sl_c3_bout4_intro", "Stack 'em up! They're tall!\nThey're prickly! They're three\nat once! It's... THE POKEY\n<k>\n<p>\nPISTONS!\n<k>",
    "sl_c3_boutE1_intro", "An exhibition bout, folks! Two\ntons of solid iron and no\nmanners! THE IRON SIDES!\n<k>",
    "sl_c3_boutE2_intro", "Exhibition time! Red, spiky,\nand very hard to jump on! THE\nRED SHELLS!\n<k>",
    "sl_c3_boutE3_intro", "The last exhibition! Hold on\nto your wallets, folks!\nIt's... THE WRECKING CREW!\n<k>",
    "sl_c3_bout_lost", "Ooooh! The rookie's DOWN!\nSomebody bring a stretcher!\nAnd a smaller stretcher for\n<k>\n<p>\nthe ego!\n<k>\n<p>\nCome back when you've had a\nnap, rookie! The ring will\nstill be here!\n<k>",
    "sl_c3_bout_won", "AND THE ROOKIE WINS! Somebody\ncheck the scoreboard! Somebody\ncheck MY EYES!\n<k>",
    "sl_c3_boutE_won", "The rookie takes the\nexhibition! And the prize! And\nmy breath away!\n<k>",
    "sl_c3_boutE1_prize", "<system>\nLuigi got the <col 0000ffff>Charge</col> badge!\n<k>",
    "sl_c3_boutE2_prize", "<system>\nLuigi got a <col 0000ffff>Star Piece</col>!\n<k>",
    "sl_c3_boutE3_prize", "<system>\nLuigi got <col 0000ffff>30 coins</col>!\n<k>",
    "sl_c3_torque_join_01", "Watched your bout on the\ngarage TV.\n<k>",
    "sl_c3_torque_join_02", "You did?! How was I?\n<k>",
    "sl_c3_torque_join_03", "Bad. Jumped too early. Hammer\nswing like a wet noodle.\n<k>",
    "sl_c3_torque_join_04", "But you didn't run. Most\nrookies run.\n<k>",
    "sl_c3_torque_join_05", "...I'll make you a deal. You\nget my parts back from Revvo's\ncrew. I'll get the Girl\n<k>\n<p>\nrunning.\n<k>\n<p>\nAnd I'll stand in your pit.\nBut if you scratch her, I'll\nscratch you.\n<k>",
    "sl_c3_torque_join_06", "Deal! Wait. How much\nscratching are we talking\nabout?\n<k>",
    "sl_c3_torque_join_07", "Name's Torque. Let's go.\n<k>",
    "sl_c3_torque_joined", "<system>\n<col 0000ffff>Torque</col> joined your party!\n<k>",
    "sl_c3_tutorial_01", "That shutter's been jammed\nsince Tuesday. Nobody on this\nisland can fix anything.\n<k>\n<p>\nWatch.\n<k>",
    "sl_c3_tutorial_03", "Stand by the shutter. Press\nthe button. I'll do the rest.\nYou do the tapping.\n<k>",
    "sl_c3_tutorial_04", "There. Wasn't hard. Everybody\nhere just hits things.\n<k>",
    "sl_c3_tutorial_05", "I hit things too! With a\nhammer!\n<k>",
    "sl_c3_tutorial_06", "I know. I saw.\n<k>",
    "sl_c3_shutter_jammed", "<system>\nIt's jammed halfway. Too low to walk\nunder, too high to step over.\n<k>",
    "sl_c3_suite_locked", "<system>\nBy order of the King: KEEP OUT.\nThis means you. Yes, you.\n<k>",
    "sl_c3_plug_got", "<system>\nYou got the <col 0000ffff>Spark Plug</col>!\n<k>",
    "sl_c3_plug_01", "One down.\n<k>",
    "sl_c3_lift_fixed", "Lift's live. Step on. Mind the\nedge.\n<k>",
    "sl_c3_gearbox_got", "<system>\nYou got the <col 0000ffff>Gearbox</col>!\n<k>",
    "sl_c3_gearbox_01", "That's my gearbox. The\nReverso-Matic. Hand-built. Six\nforward gears, one reverse.\n<k>",
    "sl_c3_gearbox_02", "Only one reverse? Is that...\nenough reverse?\n<k>",
    "sl_c3_gearbox_03", "You won't need reverse.\n<k>",
    "sl_c3_wheel_01", "Hey, it's the rookie. Heard\nyou're lookin' for a steering\nwheel.\n<k>",
    "sl_c3_wheel_02", "Funny thing. The King's got a\nnew hat rack in his suite.\nShaped like a steering wheel.\n<k>\n<p>\nReal green. Real shiny.\n<k>",
    "sl_c3_wheel_03", "Shame nobody's allowed in the\nKing's Suite. Door's locked.\nHas been since forever.\n<k>",
    "sl_c3_wheel_04", "Lug. Stop telling him things.\n<k>",
    "sl_c3_wheel_got", "<system>\nYou got the <col 0000ffff>Steering Wheel</col>!\n<k>",
    "sl_c3_wheel_05", "Well, well. A rookie, in my\nsuite, touching my hat stand.\n<k>",
    "sl_c3_wheel_06", "This is a steering wheel! It's\nTorque's! You stole it!\n<k>",
    "sl_c3_wheel_07", "\"Stole.\" Such an ugly word. I\nprefer \"won in advance.\"\nEverything on this island is\n<k>\n<p>\nmine eventually.\n<k>\n<p>\nI just save time.\n<k>",
    "sl_c3_wheel_08", "But fine. Keep the wheel.\nBuild your little green go-\nkart.\n<k>\n<p>\nYou'll still have to beat me\nin the ring before you ever\nsee a starting grid.\n<k>",
    "sl_c3_wheel_09", "Your fifth bout is with me,\nrookie. The King's Bout.\nNobody's ever won it. Nobody's\n<k>\n<p>\never finished it awake.\n<k>",
    "sl_c3_wheel_10", "Leave the door open, rookie. I\nlike a draught.\n<k>",
    "sl_c3_duct_echo", "...Smells like feet.\n<k>",
    "sl_c3_bench", "Found it in the engine. Don't\nask.\n<k>",
    "sl_c3_muffler_got", "<system>\nYou got the <col 0000ffff>Turbo Muffler</col>!\n<k>",
    "sl_c3_muffler", "Muffler. Doesn't make her\nfaster. Makes her louder. Loud\nis faster. Psychologically.\n<k>\n<p>\nI'll fit it. Gives you ten\nmore seconds on the Hourglass.\n<k>",
    "sl_c3_kart_00", "Spark plug. Gearbox. Wheel.\nGive me a minute. Don't touch\nanything.\n<k>",
    "sl_c3_kart_01", "There she is.\n<k>",
    "sl_c3_kart_02", "Oh, she's BEAUTIFUL! Look at\nher! She's green! I'm green!\nWe're both green!\n<k>",
    "sl_c3_kart_03", "Don't get attached. Get in.\n<k>",
    "sl_c3_kart_04", "Practice course is open to\nlicensed crews and their\nkarts. Take her round. Learn\n<k>\n<p>\nhow she corners.\n<k>\n<p>\nThen go win your license.\n<k>",
    "sl_c3_boss_01", "Folks, this is it! This is\nwhat you came for! In the\ngreen corner, the rookie who\n<k>\n<p>\nWOULD NOT GO HOME...\n<k>\n<p>\nLUIGI!\n<k>",
    "sl_c3_boss_02", "And in the gold corner!\nThirty-one wins! Thirty-one\ncrowns! One very large ego!\n<k>\n<p>\nHe's the Sultan of Speed! The\nDuke of Drift! He's... KING...\nREEEEVVOOOOO!\n<k>",
    "sl_c3_boss_03", "Thank you. I've been called\nworse. Not by anyone who's\nstill on this island.\n<k>",
    "sl_c3_boss_04", "Lug! Nut! Let's show the\nrookie what a pit crew is for.\n<k>",
    "sl_c3_boss_05", "Impossible. I... lost? In MY\nring?\n<k>",
    "sl_c3_boss_06", "IT'S OVER! The rookie WINS the\nKing's Bout! He's LICENSED!\nHe's IN THE RACE!\n<k>",
    "sl_c3_boss_07", "Fine. Fine! Race tomorrow,\nrookie. And as King, I set the\ngrid. You start LAST. Behind\n<k>\n<p>\neveryone.\n<k>\n<p>\nIn front of the wall.\n<k>",
    "sl_c3_boss_08", "Let's see your little green\nkart get past seven of the\nfastest machines in the world.\n<k>",
    "sl_c3_boss_license", "<system>\nYou got the <col 0000ffff>Racing License</col>!\n<k>",
    "sl_c3_boss_bazooka", "King Revvo pulls a bazooka out of\nhis shell!\n<k>\n<p>\n\"He's loading the bazooka! Rookie,\nMOVE!\"\n<k>",
    "sl_c3_boss_revving", "Revvo is revving up!\n<k>",
    "sl_c3_boss_spinout", "Revvo spins out! No Victory Lap\nthis time!\n<k>",
    "sl_c3_boss_pitstop", "\"A PIT STOP! In the MIDDLE OF A BOUT!\nIs that legal?! ...It's legal!\"\n<k>",
    "sl_c3_boss_up", "Nobody flips the King!\n<k>",
    "sl_un_revvo", "King Revvo",
    "sl_un_lug", "Lug",
    "sl_c3_night_01", "Hey, Torque? Why didn't you\never race her yourself?\n<k>",
    "sl_c3_night_02", "Can't reach the pedals.\n<k>",
    "sl_c3_night_03", "...And I build things. I don't\ndrive things. A driver's gotta\nbe a little crazy.\n<k>\n<p>\nGotta not know when to be\nscared.\n<k>",
    "sl_c3_night_04", "Oh. Well, I'm scared of almost\neverything. So I'm not sure\nthat's me.\n<k>",
    "sl_c3_night_05", "Yeah. That's what worries me.\n<k>",
    "sl_c3_night_06", "Get some sleep. Shifter's on\nthe left. Forward's up.\n<k>",
    "sl_c3_night_morning", "<system>\nRace day.\n<k>",
    "sl_c3_night_07", "Big day. Save your game,\nrookie. The track gate's at\nthe far side of the Stadium.\n<k>",
    "sl_c3_gate_practice", "The track's this way. Licensed\ncrews only. Want to take her\nround?\n<k>",
    "sl_c3_gate_race", "Race day, rookie! Your grid\nspot's waiting. Right at the\nback.\n<k>",
    "sl_c3_gate_tomorrow", "Race is tomorrow. Go get some\nsleep. Your mechanic's waiting\nin his garage.\n<k>",
    "sl_c3_gate_yesno", "<select 0 1 0 40>\nTo the track\nNot yet",
    "sl_c3_grid_sign", "<system>\nPractice course.\nLicensed crews only.\n<k>",
    "sl_c3_grid_official", "The course is open. Take a lap? Or head back in?\n<o>",
    "sl_c3_grid_choice", "<select 0 2 0 40>\nDrive a practice lap\nBack to the Stadium\nStay here",
    "sl_c3_grid_onward", "She's running. Off you go! The\ncourse is that way!\n<k>",
    "sl_c3_grid_01", "It's RACE DAY on Circuit\nBreak! Thirty thousand fans!\nEight karts! One crown!\n<k>\n<p>\nAnd one rookie in a little\ngreen kart at the very, very\nback!\n<k>",
    "sl_c3_grid_02", "Enjoy the view, rookie! It's\nall exhaust from here!\n<k>",
    "sl_c3_grid_03", "<system>\n(Torque, over the radio:)\nLeft foot off the brake. Right foot\ndown. Forward's up. Don't think.\n<k>",
    "sl_c3_grid_04", "Don't think. Don't think.\nDon't think. Oh no, now I'm\nthinking about not thinking!\n<k>",
    "sl_c3_grid_gas", "Press <icon PAD_A 0.6 0 22 0> to hit the gas!",
    "sl_c3_crash_01", "WAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAH!\n<k>",
    "sl_c3_crash_02", "...\n<k>",
    "sl_c3_crash_03", "I... I've been doing this for\ntwenty years, and I have\nNEVER... SEEN... ANYTHING LIKE\n<k>\n<p>\nTHAT!\n<k>\n<p>\nEVERY KART IS OUT! EVERY\nSINGLE ONE! EXCEPT...\n<k>",
    "sl_c3_crash_04", "Is it over? Did I win? Did I\ndie? Which one?\n<k>",
    "sl_c3_crash_05", "GET... ME... OUT... OF...\nHERE!\n<k>",
    "sl_c3_crash_06", "What did you DO to her?!\n<k>",
    "sl_c3_crash_07", "I pushed the stick FORWARD!\nLike you said! Up is forward!\n<k>",
    "sl_c3_crash_08", "...I put it in upside down.\n<k>",
    "sl_c3_crash_09", "Nobody tell anybody.\n<k>",
    "sl_c3_crash_10", "Folks, the rule book says the\nrace ISN'T OVER until somebody\nfinishes three laps!\n<k>\n<p>\nAnd there's only ONE kart that\ncan still move!\n<k>\n<p>\nIf the rookie can get that\nthing running and cross the\nline before the Royal\n<k>\n<p>\nHourglass runs out,\n<k>\n<p>\nhe's your NEW KING!\n<k>",
    "sl_c3_crash_11", "It can't move! It's upside\ndown! It's ON FIRE!\n<k>",
    "sl_c3_crash_12", "<system>\n(Jerry:) It is very slightly\non fire.\n<k>",
    "sl_c3_crash_13", "Flip her. Tune-up. Now. You\ntap, I turn.\n<k>",
    "sl_c3_crash_14", "Stand by her and press the\nbutton. Fifteen seconds a go.\nTap like you mean it.\n<k>",
    "sl_c3_crash_16", "She's running. Shifter's the\nright way up now. Go. GO!\n<k>",
    "sl_c3_lap_title", "Circuit Break Grand Prix",
    "sl_c3_lap_01", "He's OFF! The ONLY kart on the track!\nHe's in FIRST! He's also in LAST!\nHe's in EVERY position!",
    "sl_c3_lap_02", "Through the Chicane of Chaos!\nWatch that wreckage, rookie!",
    "sl_c3_lap_03", "Lap two! The King's crew are... are\nthey throwing WRENCHES?!\nThat's allowed! Everything's allowed!",
    "sl_c3_lap_04", "FINAL LAP! The Hourglass is running\nlow! Can he do it?!",
    "sl_c3_lap_05", "HE DOES IT! LUIGI WINS! LUIGI WINS\nTHE CIRCUIT BREAK GRAND PRIX!\n<k>\n<p>\nBY THREE LAPS! BY THE ENTIRE RACE!\n<k>",
    "sl_c3_lap_retry_01", "<system>\n(Torque, over the radio:)\nAgain. Smoother.\n<k>",
    "sl_c3_lap_retry_02", "<system>\n(Torque, over the radio:)\nYou're braking in the corners. Don't.\n<k>",
    "sl_c3_lap_retry_03", "<system>\n(Torque, over the radio:)\nStop hitting the scrap. The scrap\nwas there first.\n<k>",
    "sl_c3_lap_retry_04", "<system>\n(Torque, over the radio:)\nThe Hourglass resets. So do you. Go.\n<k>",
    "sl_c3_hud_hourglass", "Royal Hourglass",
    "sl_c3_hud_clock", "Medal Clock",
    "sl_c3_hud_lap", "Lap",
    "sl_c3_result_race", "Race Result: 1st (of 1)",
    "sl_c3_result_practice", "Practice Lap",
    "sl_c3_result_time", "Time",
    "sl_c3_result_dyn", "<system>\n\n<k>",
    "sl_c3_medal_gold", "<system>\nA <col c08000ff>Gold</col> lap! The track's prize:\na Shine Sprite!\n<k>",
    "sl_c3_medal_silver", "<system>\nA <col 808080ff>Silver</col> lap! The track's prize:\na Star Piece!\n<k>",
    "sl_c3_practice_coins", "<system>\nLuigi got 10 coins for finishing!\n<k>",
    "sl_c3_crown_01", "By the power vested in me by\nthe one rule in the rule\nbook...\n<k>\n<p>\nI give you the KING OF CIRCUIT\nBREAK ISLAND, until tomorrow's\nrace... KING LUIGIIIIII!\n<k>",
    "sl_c3_crown_02", "<system>\n<dynamic 3>Long live King Luigi!</dynamic>\n<k>",
    "sl_c3_crown_03", "King Luigi! Did you hear that,\nguys? KING! Me! Wait till I\ntell my brother!\n<k>\n<p>\nHe'll be SO... well, he won't\nbelieve it. But still!\n<k>",
    "sl_c3_crown_04", "Enjoy it, rookie. One day.\nTomorrow I'll be back on top.\n<k>",
    "sl_c3_crown_05", "Sure! You can have the crown\nback tomorrow. And the cape.\nAnd the parking space.\n<k>\n<p>\nI just need the little shiny\nbit on the trophy. That's all\nI came for!\n<k>",
    "sl_c3_crown_06", "...You did all this for the\nLID?\n<k>",
    "sl_c3_crown_07", "It's a very important lid!\n<k>",
    "sl_c3_crown_08", "<system>\nYou got a piece of the\n<col 0000ffff>Marvelous Compass</col>!\n<k>",
    "sl_c3_voice_01", "<system>\n<center><col 6060a0ff>...Is someone there? Someone is coming.\nI can feel it, like a lamp left on\nin a window.</col></center>\n<k>",
    "sl_c3_voice_02", "<system>\n<center><col 6060a0ff>Whoever you are... go east. Where the\nmusic never stops. And please...\ndon't give up.</col></center>\n<k>",
    "sl_c3_voice_03", "...Did you hear that? Guys?\nDid you hear her?\n<k>",
    "sl_c3_voice_04", "Hear who.\n<k>",
    "sl_c3_voice_05", "The princess! Princess Eclair!\nIt was her! It HAD to be her!\n<k>\n<p>\nA voice like that... it was\nlike... like a sunrise, if a\nsunrise could talk.\n<k>\n<p>\nAnd it said \"don't give up\"!\nTo ME!\n<k>",
    "sl_c3_voice_06", "I heard only the crowd, sir.\nAnd Lakky. Lakky is always\naudible.\n<k>",
    "sl_c3_voice_07", "East. \"Where the music never\nstops.\" The compass says\nJazzafrazz Town.\n<k>\n<p>\nPrincess, hang on! Super Luigi\nis on his way!\n<k>",
    "sl_c3_torque_comes_01", "Hold it.\n<k>",
    "sl_c3_torque_comes_02", "Seven years I've been building\nengines. Never seen anybody\ndrive like that.\n<k>\n<p>\nBackwards, crash, flip, fire,\nwin. Nobody'd believe it.\n<k>",
    "sl_c3_torque_comes_03", "Somebody's gotta follow you\naround and fix whatever you\nbreak next. Might as well be\n<k>\n<p>\nme.\n<k>",
    "sl_c3_torque_comes_04", "You mean it? You're coming?\nBut what about the Girl?\n<k>",
    "sl_c3_torque_comes_05", "She's retired. Undefeated.\nBest record on the island. One\nrace, one win.\n<k>",
    "sl_c3_tag_caption", "As Torque tells it",
    "sl_c3_tag_01", "People ask me about the\nreverse start. Yeah. That was\nmine.\n<k>",
    "sl_c3_tag_02", "Rear-launch strategy. Took me\nsix years to design. You go\nbackwards,\n<k>\n<p>\nyou build up momentum off the\nwall, then you slingshot.\nPhysics.\n<k>",
    "sl_c3_tag_03", "The other drivers? They\npanicked. Didn't understand\nwhat they were seeing.\n<k>\n<p>\nGenius usually looks like an\naccident.\n<k>",
    "sl_c3_tag_04", "The shifter? Upside down on\npurpose. Element of surprise.\nEven the driver didn't know.\n<k>",
    "sl_c3_tag_05", "...Don't tell him that last\npart.\n<k>",
    "sl_c3_diary", "Circuit Break Island crowned a new king for a day, and the Marvelous Compass had its fourth part.\n<k>\n<p>\nIts needle swung east, toward\nJazzafrazz Town. Big Green 01\nretired undefeated.\n<k>",
    "sl_c3_npc_fan_01", "The race is every day. The\nking is every day. The parking\nspace is every day. It's a lot\n<k>\n<p>\nof days.\n<k>",
    "sl_c3_npc_fan_02", "You beat REVVO in the ring?\nNobody's gonna believe that. I\ndon't believe it and I was\n<k>\n<p>\nTHERE.\n<k>",
    "sl_c3_npc_fan_03", "I knew it! I knew it all\nalong! Backwards was the only\nway to win! Everybody knows\n<k>\n<p>\nthat!\n<k>",
    "sl_c3_npc_club_01", "Revvo Fan Club badges! Two\ncoins! One coin if you say\n\"Long live King Revvo\"! Free\n<k>\n<p>\nif you mean it!\n<k>",
    "sl_c3_npc_club_02", "Luigi Fan Club badges! I've\nALWAYS been in the Luigi Fan\nClub. I'm the president. Since\n<k>\n<p>\nthis morning.\n<k>",
    "sl_c3_npc_pianta_01", "Souvenirs! Revvo foam fingers!\nRevvo hats! Revvo... more\nRevvo! It's all Revvo!\n<k>",
    "sl_c3_npc_pianta_02", "A rookie winning bouts? I'd\nbetter order some green foam\nfingers. Just in case. A small\n<k>\n<p>\nbox.\n<k>",
    "sl_c3_npc_pianta_03", "Green foam fingers! Get your\ngreen foam fingers! I ordered\na VERY big box! Always\n<k>\n<p>\nbelieved in you!\n<k>",
    "sl_c3_npc_crew_01", "A rookie in Pit Lane? Somebody\nfetch the first aid kit. The\nbig one.\n<k>",
    "sl_c3_npc_crew_02", "Two bouts, huh? Lucky. Luck\nruns out round here. Usually\naround bout three.\n<k>",
    "sl_c3_npc_crew_03", "You beat the King in his own\nring? ...Doesn't matter.\nNobody beats him on the TRACK.\n<k>",
    "sl_c3_npc_crew_04", "I saw it coming. Backwards!\nClassic! The oldest trick in\nthe book. Page one.\n<k>",
    "sl_c3_npc_crew_11", "I'd give you a tip, rookie,\nbut you won't be here long\nenough to use it.\n<k>",
    "sl_c3_npc_crew_12", "The Spike Strip didn't get\nyou? Huh. Maybe you've got\nthick boots.\n<k>",
    "sl_c3_npc_crew_13", "Licensed? YOU? I need to sit\ndown. Somebody bring me an oil\ndrum.\n<k>",
    "sl_c3_npc_crew_14", "Every team on the island is\nfixing karts today. Except\nTorque. He's just smiling.\n<k>\n<p>\nIt's terrifying.\n<k>",
    "sl_c3_npc_driver_01", "Look, the rookie came to see\nreal karts. Take a good look.\nIt's the closest you'll get.\n<k>",
    "sl_c3_npc_driver_02", "I was looking BACKWARDS! Who\nlooks backwards in a RACE?!\n<k>",
    "sl_c3_npc_driver_11", "Ticking? That's not me. That's\nmy engine. ...Mostly my\nengine.\n<k>",
    "sl_c3_npc_driver_12", "My kart's in seven pieces.\nEight if you count me.\n<k>",
    "sl_c3_npc_driver_21", "Revvo says you'll start behind\nthe wall. Heh. Behind it.\n<k>",
    "sl_c3_npc_driver_22", "I saw the whole thing. Then a\nscoreboard sat on me. Then I\nsaw nothing.\n<k>",
    "sl_c3_npc_blastard_01", "Welcome to Row B, home of the\nBlastards, the proudest team\nnever to finish a race!\n<k>\n<p>\nWait... green kerchief...\nJerry of Plumpbelly? THE\nJerry? Of the Hizza business?\n<k>",
    "sl_c3_npc_blastard_02", "The very same.\n<k>",
    "sl_c3_npc_blastard_03", "Those lockers at the end have\nbeen rattling for weeks.\nSomething's back there. We'd\n<k>\n<p>\ncheck, but we'd blow it up.\n<k>",
    "sl_c3_npc_blastard_04", "Backwards! Into a wall! On\npurpose! You're a Blastard at\nheart, mister!\n<k>",
    0,
};
